.devfleet/

# --- The story bible (LOCAL ONLY, IRREPLACEABLE) ---
# /story/ is the END TIMES canon: plot, characters, fates, scene scripts.
# It is private and it is NOT backed up by this repo. Never publish it, and
# never run `git clean -fd` (or any destructive clean) here — an ignored,
# untracked folder is exactly what those commands delete. Leading slash =
# the repo-root folder only.
/story/

# --- Nate's private control panel + drop zone (LOCAL ONLY) ---
# Instructions/to-do for Nate now live at nate-drop/NATE.md beside the files.
# Never published — the public repo shows none of this.
nate-drop/

